OL,3,ATwo pilots injured after RAF aircraft
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo pilots have been injured after
OL,7,Freports of a crash involving RAF
OL,8,Ftraining aircraft.
OL,10,FNorth Wales Police said the pilots were
OL,11,Fbeing treated for minor injuries
OL,12,Ffollowing the incident in the
OL,13,FPencarnisiog area of Anglesey.
OL,15,FThe force said helicopters from the
OL,16,FCoastguard and the Wales Air Ambulance
OL,17,Fwere at the scene close to RAF Valley
OL,18,Fon the island.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
